<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">For <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'></span>
<span class="gem8"> Alliance</span> players, any <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_draenei_male.gif");'></span> Draenei grants 1% Hit to their party through <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=28878/heroic-presence">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_21.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heroic Presence</span></a>.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="c11">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_druid.gif");'>Balance Druid</span></span> with the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=33602/improved-faerie-fire">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_faeriefire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Improved Faerie Fire</span></a> talent or <span class="c5">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_priest.gif");'></span>Shadow Priest</span> with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=33193/misery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_misery.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Misery</span></a> increasing our hit chance by 3%.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=18176/suppression">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_unsummonbuilding.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Suppression</span></a> also gives us another 3% hit chance. (As Destruction you most likely won't have to talent into <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=18176/suppression">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_unsummonbuilding.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Suppression</span></a>).</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">We also gain other stats based on our raid composition and whilst they have a minor impact on the relative value of our stats, they do not have a maximum amount where they are beneficial like hit rating. This makes it so that those things are less likely to show up or cause us to gear differently.</div></li></ul></div>The recommendations listed below for each gear slot are simply that - <b>recommendations</b>. They have been chosen based on a combination of Spell Power /<wbr/> Crit /<wbr/> Hit /<wbr/> Intellect /<wbr/> Spirit, and we have taken care to provide a range of alternatives. For more specific situations, the <a href="https://discord.gg/8mrt6DE" target="_blank">Classic Warlock Discord</a> maintains a <a href="https://wowsims.github.io/wotlk/warlock/" target="_blank">Gear and DPS Simulator</a> which will help you evaluate the best combination of gear available to you.<div class="clear"></div>
<div class="smooth-nav-wrapper" id="nav-markup-wowhead-guid-1711017091985-1711017092000-1441407872-2">
<div class="smooth-nav-outer">
<div class="smooth-nav-inner">
<a data-text="destruction-warlock-stats" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/guide/classes/warlock/Destruction/dps-stat-priority-attributes-pve" id="nav-markup-wowhead-guid-1711017091985-1711017092000-1441407872-2-81" rel="np">Destruction Warlock Stats</a>
<a data-text="warlock-discord" href="https://discord.gg/8mrt6DE" id="nav-markup-wowhead-guid-1711017091985-1711017092000-1441407872-2-81" rel="np">Warlock Discord</a>
<a data-text="gear-and-dps-simulator" href="https://wowsims.github.io/wotlk/warlock/" id="nav-markup-wowhead-guid-1711017091985-1711017092000-1441407872-2-81" rel="np">Gear and DPS Simulator</a></div></div></div>There are a plethora of different gearing approaches one can take before ever setting foot inside a raid. The following only goes over loot available from the new Gamma Heroic currency (the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2711/defilers-scourgestone">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Defiler's Scourgestone</span></span></a>) used for <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a> 25-man normal items, and items available through <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=101/emblem-of-heroism">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_proclaimchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Heroism</span></span></a>, <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=102/emblem-of-valor">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_proclaimchampion_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Valor</span></span></a>, <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=221/emblem-of-conquest">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_championsgrace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Conquest</span></span></a>, <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
