<div>
<div class="tabbed-contents">
<div id="tab-best-in-slot-embed-alliance" style="">
<h5 class="heading-size-5 first" id="alliance-best-in-slot">
<div style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<img alt="" class="no-border" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/icons/alliance.png"/> <span class="gem8">Alliance Best in Slot</span></div></h5>This is what our <b>theoretical</b> Pre-Raid Best in Slot setup would look like. This is based on simulating a specific scenario with <span class="c11">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_druid.gif");'>Balance Druid</span></span> with the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=33602/improved-faerie-fire">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_faeriefire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Improved Faerie Fire</span></a> talent or <span class="c5">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_priest.gif");'></span>Shadow Priest</span> with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=33193/misery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_misery.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Misery</span></a> increasing our hit chance by 3%, a <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_draenei_male.gif");'>Draenei</span> granting you 1% Hit through <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=28878/heroic-presence">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_21.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heroic Presence</span></a>, as well as the provided talents in the embed. However, as with every theory, it does not always reflect reality. You are unlikely to obtain all these items or for example, have an optimal raid composition. As always you should <a href="https://discord.gg/8mrt6DE" target="_blank">sim</a> for yourself and your unique situation.<br/>
<br/>
