<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-bind-on-equip">Best Bind on Equip Items for Destruction Warlock DPS - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>Here we will cover several items that are Bind on Equipped, meaning are tradable and can be bought at the Auction House if listed. Some of these are crafted with expansive materials or are rare drops from raids. This often means that they won't be cheap, and most will be eventually replaced with raid gear.<br/>
