<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-gems">Best Gems for Destruction Warlock DPS - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>For gemming, you will want to use these slots to balance out your Hit and reach your meta gem requirement. Most often it is not worthwhile to get the gem bonus unless it is a spell damage bonus or spell hit bonus. For more in-depth info on gems, see the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-enchants-gems-pve">Gem Guide.</a>
<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<ul class="first last">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Meta Socket - <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41285/chaotic-skyflare-diamond">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_icediamond_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chaotic Skyflare Diamond</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Red Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40113/runed-cardinal-ruby">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_37.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Runed Cardinal Ruby</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45883/runed-stormjewel">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_37.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Runed Stormjewel</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Blue Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40133/purified-dreadstone">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Purified Dreadstone</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Yellow Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40155/reckless-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reckless Ametrine</span></a>, (<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40153/veiled-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Veiled Ametrine</span></a> in case you need additional hit rating)</div></li></ul></div></div>The gems displayed in the Socket Slots of the items are based on whether it is worth getting the Socket Bonus.  For your Meta requirement, you will want to use items with blue socket slots that give a good bonus (high spell power, hit, or haste).<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-enchants">Best Enchants for Destruction Warlock DPS - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>The enchants are always the same, if you're using a staff like <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40489/greatstaff-of-the-nexus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_83.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greatstaff of the Nexus</span></a>, then make sure you use the upgraded enchant for staves <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45056/scroll-of-enchant-staff-greater-spellpower">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_scroll_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scroll of Enchant Staff - Greater Spellpower</span></a>. Also remember that to use <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55642/lightweave-embroidery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightweave Embroidery</span></a> you need Tailoring, and to use <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41118/nitro-boosts">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_rocketbootextreme.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=54999/hyperspeed-accelerators">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hyperspeed Accelerators</span></a> you need to be an Engineer.<div class="quote-box last" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<ul class="first last">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Head - <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44159/arcanum-of-burning-mysteries">
